# This service is raw vLLM. The compose command honors exactly three keys from
# this file: NIM_GPU_MEM_FRACTION (-> --gpu-memory-utilization; defaults 0.85
# dedicated / 0.40 shared), NIM_MAX_MODEL_LEN (-> --max-model-len) and
# NIM_MAX_NUM_SEQS (-> --max-num-seqs). Other NIM_* keys have no effect here.
